<title>UK: Saudi livestock ship has fire in feed storage hold.</title>
<headline>Saudi livestock ship has fire in feed storage hold.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Saudi Arabian-flag livestock carrier Mawashi Tabuk returned to Adelaide early on Wednesday with a fire in its animal feed storage hold, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said.</p>
<p>The fire was brought under control and the vessel is now berthed at the outer harbour. The 18,328 dwt Mawashi Tabuk had left Adelaide on Monday for Timaru, New Zealand.</p>
